    "No parent atlas river passes through the city; upland storage and drainage are separate later source sites, not an invented city river.",
    "The southern harbor indentation is a local proposal inside coarse coastal geography, not a source shoreline projection. Tides, wave exposure, seasonal ice, bathymetry and actual berths remain unengineered.",
    "Brin is at61N with14.07degree adopted seasonal tilt; no geometric polar night or ordinary Rauth view. Local terrain and cloud alter received light.",
